ga","C:/ProgramData/Epic/EpicGamesLauncher/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Willowwood_-_Free_Low_Poly_Nature_Pack-02523a32/fbx/fab_freelowpolypack_extracted/textures/T_WillowTreeLeavesEmisssive.tga"],"metadata":{"launcher":{"version":"0.0.1","listening_port":24563},"fab":{"assetNamespace":"fab","listing":{"averageRating":3.3999999999999999,"createdAt":"","description":"<p><strong><em>The package includes Unreal Engine project set up in version 5.1, .FBX and a sample scene provided as an Unity package.</em></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><em>*In version 1.1, water was added to the Unreal Engine file.</em></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><em>**Sample scene and YouTube video shown in the promotional materials were created in </em></strong><span class=\"fabkit-prose-color--yellow\"><strong><em>Unity.</em></strong></span></p><p></p><p>Asset pack trailer on Youtube:<span class=\"fabkit-prose-color--yellow\"><strong><em> </em></strong></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gxHrBSRVoeE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span class=\"fabkit-prose-color--yellow\"><strong>link</strong></span></a></p><p></p><p>Low Poly Nature Pack is a free collection of stylized environment assets for creating peaceful forests, fantasy areas, adventure levels, RPG scenes, survival maps, or prototype worlds. The pack includes nature props such as trees, willow trees, rocks, cliffs, grass, flowers, water pieces, a wooden bridge, fences, ruins, campfire props, mushrooms, spider webs, and small decorative elements. </p><p>Assets are suitable for low poly, casual, fantasy, adventure, and mobile games. They can be combined to quickly build forest paths, mountain areas, riversides, campsites, ruins, and small outdoor scenes.</p>","isAiForbidden":true,"isAiGenerated":false,"lastUpdatedAt":"","listingType":"3d-model","media":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/0283b310-fc74-4a88-b071-8b2f652a8cf7/2d6aab72-2306-4427-a104-4c51ba8094de.jpg","publishedAt":"2026-08-19T16:14:19.106864Z"